msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All these fancy furnishings.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫do⟪k:4⟫ know this stuff’s too good for you, "
"right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫비싼 장식품만 쫙 깔아 놓고 말이야, ⟪k:1⟫너랑 안 맞는 물건이란 걸 알긴 아는지 몰라."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FDB1C6BD_EE5D_4586_B01F_C97FEA02B2DB
