msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then me, I get that barren little maid’s room.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Drives me up the wall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그에 비하면 ⟪k:1⟫난 썰렁한 메이드용 방――. ⟪k:2⟫아주 신물이 나."

