msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahahaha... ⟪k:1⟫I ⟪k:2⟫love⟪k:3⟫ that look on your face!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m guessing you didn’t "
"make things better, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아하하……, ⟪k:1⟫보기 좋은 낯짝인걸!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫꼬라질 보니 ⟪k:4⟫화해는 못 했구나?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_91F838AB_E2A8_4777_AF54_F0769624E82D
