msgid "⟪k:0⟫You know... ⟪k:1⟫good and well!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That she’s not even here anymore!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫알고서…… 하는 소리지……!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 녀석이 이미 ⟪k:3⟫이 집에 없단 걸……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BBF97309_8CC3_4DD8_854E_AE3C9466564C
