msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, yeah, but I still wanna hear ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫ say it, y’know?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇긴 한데, ⟪k:1⟫네 아가리로 듣고 싶거든?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D0928CDF_1AAF_4059_8987_0C6AC9575F43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 512479f79d642d6e9d3a045c68c07ee33a43a25d28ec139959e93262a0e04cc1
