msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pffft, ⟪k:1⟫baha, ⟪k:2⟫hahahaha...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Go on, say something.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Climb back on "
"your high horse and start shouting like you always do!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫흐흡, ⟪k:1⟫크, ⟪k:2⟫크크큭……, ⟪k:3⟫자, ⟪k:4⟫아무 말이라도 해 봐.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫다른 때처럼 개폼 잡"
"고 ⟪k:7⟫뻐겨 보라고!!"

