#: scenario3:scenario3_17D4883B_50CA_4CDD_BC6E_79BE38110923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 743204d3e571b6b0da38b7a6beaa52446f2f79435abb1914409ea71a34dab378
