msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonsense!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She was ⟪k:3⟫waiting⟪k:4⟫ for me!⟪k:5⟫Until the day of the joining "
"ceremony!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무슨 소릴……!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 녀석은 개통식 날까지 ⟪k:3⟫기다리려 했잖아――!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74FEB0BA_DF3D_4B4B_9CF3_6D6C99B316E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ede020521743de8092fc59629f39cb26b6eebeb07bcc931ddfb1c6b8d1f8c22
#. default-sha256: 7ef98663c5134300ab90b2d64041119ac5b727d9a9cb0d10f1aa2409089b8ac2
