msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I was going to see her on that day!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You knew the ceremony had been postponed!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나도 ⟪k:1⟫그 날 데리러 가려 했어……!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 녀석도 개통식 연기 소식을 ⟪k:4⟫알고 있었을 텐"
"데……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3a88d4ed0952c08d43fce8f8de82ae123c93ae78e867c8b3d80c487912a6903
#. default-sha256: 3d789c91b89c4237323a5e5bded49ad476dabd2f05ba50c54a065cfbdd406ab2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what you get for putting it all in my hands.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For thinking I’m the only one "
"on your side!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나한테 다 맡기면 쓰나?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫내가 유일한 아군인 줄 알긴!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a834e468c046cb6818e27d93ec78d5f4a4643f482c14d3ce5eaae752ba7aafd4
#. default-sha256: a6d8918c1519703d721ecbe539774e116a9922eb241cd6131310c0309fc235dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What, did you think I’d just ⟪k:1⟫tell her⟪k:2⟫ like a good little maid?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Not a "
"chance in ⟪k:6⟫hell⟪k:7⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 그걸 똑바로 전해 줄 것 같아? ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫――그럴 리가 없잖아!"

